        <item>
            <title>0.18.27</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:34:13 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.27</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.27</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Every browser has a Context menu</strong> — Chrome, Arc, Dia and any other browser now open with eight pills: Back, Forward, Reload, New Tab, Close Tab, Reopen Closed Tab, Find and Address Bar. Hold ⌥ Option on New Tab for a Private Window. A browser that already has its own menu keeps it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
